    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d98">

                <pb facs="0185" n="139" xml:id="pg139"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72119/1804½a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Representative Thomas
                        Gallagher </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-07-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 11, 1918</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Gallagher</hi>: I have given most
                    careful consideration to the draft of the proposed resolution relative to Poland
                    which you submitted to me on June 14 and to your request for an expression of my
                    views as to the propriety of introducing such a resolution in the House of
                    Representatives.</p>
                <p>It is my opinion, and I know I share the views of the President in this respect,
                    that it is not wise to take action piecemeal with regard to a final settlement.
                    Our attitude is clearly spoken by our actions which can leave the world in no
                    doubt as to where we stand. We have already recognized the representatives of a
                    Polish State. If we are to be definite in the case of this particular national
                    aspiration, it might well be said that we should be equally definite in the case
                    of the others, and we should hardly know where to stop, definition being at each
                    step increasingly difficult. I think it would be wiser then to defer the
                    introduction of this resolution.</p>
                <p>Thanking you for having consulted me in this matter, I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>[File copy not signed]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
